n Song1964: Rehearsal for The Ed Sullivan Show1963: The Beatles live: Locarno Ballroom, Liverpool1962: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)1961: The Beatles live: Litherland Town Hall, Liverpool1961: The Beatles live: Cassanova Club, LiverpoolWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
